{"overview":"یک بازیکن MMO بیدار می‌شود و به عنوان طغیان‌گر پر بال سیاه، لوفاس مافاهال، که از سرنوشت مهرمانه‌اش برخیزد، می‌شود—فقط برای اینکه متوجه شود این واقعاً واقعی است. شکست او ۲۰۰ سال پیش هیولاهای مرگ را آزاد کرده بود و افسانه‌ای از ترس است. اکنون، در بدن قدرتمندترین فاتح تاریخ گرفتار شده، او باید در جهانی که می‌خواهد او را بکشد، زنده بماند… و چرا در اینجا است را کشف کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"An MMO gamer awakens as the Black-Winged Tyrant, Lufas Maphaahl, rising from her sealed fate—only to find this is very real. Her defeat 200 years ago unleashed monsters of death, and the legend is one of terror. Now, trapped in the body of history's most feared conqueror, he must survive a world that wants her dead…and uncover why he's here.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2025,"poster":"/uLkimDmIWb4VdgFUuiMlS8wGi5S.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/2pQHfraIKbqcOYgdq6H96tqHFop.jpg"}],"episodes":23,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小清水亜美","role":"Lufas Maphaahl (voice)","photo":"/e5sU0stGjTMtFoj0jjHH7OFUqYC.jpg","en":"Ami Koshimizu"},{"name":"薄井友里","role":"Dina (voice)","photo":"/yY3HhdrEfgplJ4KKwT4wXgIeGTZ.jpg","en":"Yuri Usui"},{"name":"首藤志奈","role":"Aries (voice)","photo":"/mxIpJabfqqJWNjJBzEnJrRDyOsE.jpg","en":"Yukina Shuto"},{"name":"内田直哉","role":"Aigokeros (voice)","photo":"/i1Vl4QbiEsyATmX2HSH2rIEyzeS.jpg","en":"Naoya Uchida"},{"name":"東城日沙子","role":"Libra (voice)","photo":"/oWXhLQN274DMfQfM39ukoZc70or.jpg","en":"Hisako Tojo"},{"name":"大森こころ","role":"Virgo (voice)","photo":"/kWFIBZA39oPW9J2SM4OuZqw8u28.jpg","en":"Cocoro Omori"}],"trailer":"Y_G0A8ohFLo","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/280042/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","lo